0..77 Comment "// The twin of `model/desc/relative-monad.gandr`: an associativity that drops"
78..148 Comment "// the inner continuation, whose overlap with the left unit law parts."
150..220 Comment "/// Extending an extension by `l` is extending by `l` alone: the inner"
221..300 Comment "/// continuation `k` is lost. Against the left unit law at `ext(ext(ret(a), k),"
301..362 Comment "/// l)`, one rule leaves `l(a)` and the other `ext(k(a), l)`."
